## 1. Gate-event rarity in the training logs
r_node = share of eligible node-rounds with a>=g; r_round / r_ep = share of rounds / episodes with at least one; n_hit = such node-rounds; n_a1 = eligible node-rounds with a=1 (the events that refute IC under a gate); miss = (1-r)^N

